note contract 6 line 175: o is evaluated before k. o = div 10 z (z = 0) traps 2, k = ulong m (m = -1)
note traps 5: exit 102. A k-first mutant exits 105.
om2
fn plen v view uchar * to ulong
ret len v
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 0
z = ulong 0
m = long -1
putd plen part a div 10 z ulong m
ret 0
end
